d the browser encoder to match.\n\n## Source\n\n- [Phase 13 plan](https://github.com/developing-today/code/blob/main/.opencode/plans/phase-13-client-shells.md) — F13.5\n- #564 (Phase 13 plan task)\n- #535 (input and presentation designs) — D1-053\n\n## Current status\n\nNot started. Key.parse decodes legacy sequences only (pkgs/id/examples/roc-world/Key.roc); no negotiation in pkgs/id/src/world_ssh.rs.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] A kitty-protocol terminal and the web encoder produce the same key event for the same keystroke (parity test)\n- [ ] Escape vs Alt is unambiguous on a kitty-protocol terminal\n- [ ] The raw input path carries the richer key events without changing the durable Input event\n\n## Size\n\nM\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- #564 (Phase 13 plan task) — F13.4 presentation tiers (detection precedes negotiation)\n","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/787/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https:/